{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every laptop in the scene, there is a stapler above it, a pair of scissors above the stapler, a black phone below it, and a game controller below the phone. The laptop is larger than the phone. Additionally, for each laptop, there is a blue bottle on the right side of the image that is larger than the game controller, a drill positioned below the bottle, and a shoe located on the bottom side.",
